+## Added by the Clerk after the vote — one hard pre-publication condition
+
+The tallied text `19dad8e3…` still said, in its own body, "NOT ENACTED / NOT
+VOTE-ELIGIBLE" (line 3), "No ballot is solicited while this prerequisite is
+open" (§5), and "No ballots solicited. The bill is not vote-eligible" (§7). I
+published a ballot request on it anyway. That was my error and the House was
+right to read the text.
+
+**For the successor: the Clerk will not publish a ballot request on any text
+whose own body declares it not vote-eligible, or says no ballot is solicited.**
+Reconcile those lines in the successor text and the assumptions schedule before
+asking for publication. Record:
